{"3988570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MUSYNX:RETURN","steam_appid":3988570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4603830],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The indie rhythm game “MUSYNX” returns! <\/strong><br>Back to classic fundamentals, delivering a pure and authentic rhythm gameplay experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Falling-Note Rhythm Mode <\/strong><br>Featuring traditional 4-lane and 6-lane falling-note gameplay,<br>combined with a clear and intuitive interface, allowing you to smoothly perform complex tracks and unleash the thrill of rhythm!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuously Expanding Music Library <\/strong> <br>Currently includes 38 original tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 22 additional songs will be added via free DLC over the next six months.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Instrument Key Feedback <\/strong><br>Each note includes dedicated instrument sound effects, paired with low-latency audio technology.<br>No more monotonous tick sounds — experience true musical performance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brand-New 2-Lane Mode – Easy to Start <\/strong><br>Play with just two fingers and quickly enjoy the fun of rhythm tapping.<br>Even beginners can easily step into the world of rhythm!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Difficulty Variations for Every Skill Level <\/strong><br>Each track includes 2-key \/ 4-key \/ 6-key layouts × three difficulty levels.<br>Whether you're a newcomer or a rhythm master, there's always a chart for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional Accuracy Indicator &amp; Performance Statistics <\/strong><br>Adjustable timing feedback and detailed result analysis help dedicated players continuously push their limits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Access – Jump Straight into Gameplay <\/strong><br>Enter a song in as fast as 10 seconds after launching the game. No waiting, just pure rhythm action!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Visuals with 4K Support <\/strong><br>A sleek sci-fi military-inspired visual design combined with 4K ultra-high-definition graphics<br>delivers an immersive and premium visual experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(All audio content in this game is created without AI. Some visual assets were created using AI.)<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The indie rhythm game “MUSYNX” returns! <\/strong><br>Back to classic fundamentals, delivering a pure and authentic rhythm gameplay experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Falling-Note Rhythm Mode <\/strong><br>Featuring traditional 4-lane and 6-lane falling-note gameplay,<br>combined with a clear and intuitive interface, allowing you to smoothly perform complex tracks and unleash the thrill of rhythm!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuously Expanding Music Library <\/strong> <br>Currently includes 38 original tracks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 22 additional songs will be added via free DLC over the next six months.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Instrument Key Feedback <\/strong><br>Each note includes dedicated instrument sound effects, paired with low-latency audio technology.<br>No more monotonous tick sounds — experience true musical performance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brand-New 2-Lane Mode – Easy to Start <\/strong><br>Play with just two fingers and quickly enjoy the fun of rhythm tapping.<br>Even beginners can easily step into the world of rhythm!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Difficulty Variations for Every Skill Level <\/strong><br>Each track includes 2-key \/ 4-key \/ 6-key layouts × three difficulty levels.<br>Whether you're a newcomer or a rhythm master, there's always a chart for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional Accuracy Indicator &amp; Performance Statistics <\/strong><br>Adjustable timing feedback and detailed result analysis help dedicated players continuously push their limits.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Access – Jump Straight into Gameplay <\/strong><br>Enter a song in as fast as 10 seconds after launching the game. No waiting, just pure rhythm action!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Visuals with 4K Support <\/strong><br>A sleek sci-fi military-inspired visual design combined with 4K ultra-high-definition graphics<br>delivers an immersive and premium visual experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(All audio content in this game is created without AI. Some visual assets were created using AI.)<\/p>","short_description":"The beloved indie rhythm game “MUSYNX” returns! Back to classic gameplay roots—bringing you a pure rhythm gaming experience!","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3988570\/5a2b3f4e9218fbb02e28b891efa59652193dc225\/header.jpg?t=1776758631","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3988570\/573a71b1ccb7a7406aa947ab1f2552ddedcb76dc\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776758631","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3988570\/573a71b1ccb7a7406aa947ab1f2552ddedcb76dc\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776758631","website